        {
          "en": "I Spy beginning letters To help the child to notice words beginning with the same letter.",
          "zh": "我间谍开始信到帮助这孩子到布告单词开始和……一起这同样的信。",
          "startMs": 38977,
          "endMs": 48719
        },
        {
          "en": "• Find 'by' on page 1.",
          "zh": "• 找到 '由' 在……上页 1。",
          "startMs": 48719,
          "endMs": 51127
        },
        {
          "en": "I spy a word beginning with 'b\" , and look for other words beginning with 'b' in the book ('back\", 'barn', 'barked\").",
          "zh": "我间谍一个单词开始和……一起 '第二， 和看为了其他单词开始和……一起 '第二' 在……里这书 ('回来， '谷仓'， '吠叫)。",
          "startMs": 51127,
          "endMs": 63934
        },
        {
          "en": "The child then thinks of another beginning letter and looks for words beginning with that letter.",
          "zh": "这孩子然后想的另一个开始信和看为了单词开始和……一起那个信。",
          "startMs": 63934,
          "endMs": 74552
        },
        {
          "en": "Have two or three turns each.",
          "zh": "有二或者三转动每个。",
          "startMs": 74552,
          "endMs": 77726
        },
        {
          "en": "You can use these ideas straight away, or on another day.",
          "zh": "你能使用这些主意直的离开， 或者在……上另一个一天。",
          "startMs": 77726,
          "endMs": 83966
        },
        {
          "en": "• Look at all the people on pages 2 and 3 of the story.",
          "zh": "• 看在全部这人们在……上页 2 和 3 的这故事。",
          "startMs": 83966,
          "endMs": 89986
        },
        {
          "en": "Talk about what each was doing before they ran to see the fire.",
          "zh": "谈话关于什么每个是做在……之前他们跑到看见这火。",
          "startMs": 89986,
          "endMs": 96882
        },
        {
          "en": "Look for the word 'fire' in the story.",
          "zh": "看为了这单词 '火' 在……里这故事。",
          "startMs": 96882,
          "endMs": 101041
        },
